    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/ecommerce-clothing/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Ecommerce Clothing theme is a modern, stylish, and responsive solution designed for online apparel stores, fashion boutiques, clothing brands, sportswear retailers, casual wear shops, luxury fashion outlets, kids’ clothing stores, maternity wear shops, footwear and accessory stores, and online fashion marketplaces. Perfect for showcasing product collections, seasonal offers, new arrivals, featured items, and trending outfits, the theme provides a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections for product displays, banners, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, testimonials, and promotional highlights to enhance customer engagement. Built with clean, optimized code, the theme allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to reflect your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for product listings, online sales, and payment processing, Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries, and Jetpack for performance, security, and social integration, the Ecommerce Clothing theme delivers a professional, SEO-friendly, and high-performing platform to grow your fashion business online."
    },
